<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-158.2-cost-variance-actual-vs-standard-and-margin-analytics" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4657" name="W4657. Purchase-Price Variance (PPV) Analysis &amp; Vendor Accountability" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: PO receipt where actual price ≠ standard; monthly variance review
Frequency: Per receipt (system) + monthly review
Volume: ~72,000 receipts/yr; ~ top-200 vendors = 85% COGS
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager
Participants: Procurement (VS-03), Merchandising (VS-01), Vendor Mgmt (VS-67), Controller
Source: workflow W4657 — Purchase-Price Variance (PPV) Analysis &amp; Vendor Accountability</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4657_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4657_Lane1" name="Cost Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4657_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4657_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4657_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4657_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4657_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4657_Start3" name="PO receipt where actual price ≠ standard; monthly variance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4657_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W4657_Task4" name="Capture PPV at every receipt (actual purchase price − standard cost); post to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Capture PPV at every receipt (actual purchase price − standard cost); post to the PPV P&amp;L account and accumulate by vendor/category/SKU
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / System
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per receipt</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4657_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4657_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4657_Task5" name="Analyze PPV monthly: favorable vs. unfavorable by vendor/category; route…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Analyze PPV monthly: favorable vs. unfavorable by vendor/category; route unfavorable variances exceeding threshold to Procurement/Vendor Mgmt for vendor accountability and negotiation (VS-03.3/VS-67)
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Procurement
Accountable (A): Controller / VP Merchandising
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4657_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4657_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4657_Task6" name="Feed recurring PPV into the next standard-cost roll (W4656) so the standard…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Feed recurring PPV into the next standard-cost roll (W4656) so the standard reflects the new actual; track PPV trend as a procurement-KPI input (VS-67 scorecard)
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Procurement
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per roll</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4657_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4657_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4657_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4657_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4657_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-705 (ensure controlled execution — Cost Variance, Actual-vs-Standard &amp; Margin Analytics (PA-158.2).) | - CTL-705: PPV captured at every receipt; unfavorable variances &gt; threshold routed and reviewed; PPV feeds the standard roll
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4657_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4657_Annotation8" targetRef="W4657_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4657_Flow10" sourceRef="W4657_Start3" targetRef="W4657_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4657_Flow11" sourceRef="W4657_Task4" targetRef="W4657_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4657_Flow12" sourceRef="W4657_Task5" targetRef="W4657_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4657_Flow13" sourceRef="W4657_Task6" targetRef="W4657_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4657_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4657_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4657">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4657_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4657_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
