    <bpmn:process id="W_W4660" name="W4660. Inventory Adjustment, Write-Down &amp; NRV Cost Impact" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Inventory adjustment (VS-05); shrinkage (VS-23); NRV review at close (W9)
Frequency: Monthly + at close
Volume: ~ shrinkage &lt;1.5% target; slow-moving/obsolete (SLOB) inventory
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager
Participants: Inventory (VS-05), Loss Prevention (VS-23), Controller, FP&amp;A (VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W4660 — Inventory Adjustment, Write-Down &amp; NRV Cost Impact</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4660_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4660_Lane1" name="Cost Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4660_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4660_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4660_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4660_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4660_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4660_Start3" name="Inventory adjustment (VS-05); shrinkage (VS-23); NRV review at close (W9)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4660_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4660_Task4" name="Post the cost impact of inventory adjustments (shrinkage, damage, count…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Post the cost impact of inventory adjustments (shrinkage, damage, count variances — VS-05.1/VS-23) to the correct cost account (write-off vs. variance) using the current standard cost
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Inventory
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4660_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4660_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4660_Task5" name="At each close (W9), perform the lower-of-cost-or-NRV review (PFRS/IAS 2)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: At each close (W9), perform the lower-of-cost-or-NRV review (PFRS/IAS 2): identify slow-moving/obsolete stock (W220), estimate NRV vs. carrying cost, and book the write-down provision
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Controller / CFO
Duration: Per close</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4660_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4660_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4660_Task6" name="Reconcile total inventory cost to the GL inventory account and the WAC…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconcile total inventory cost to the GL inventory account and the WAC verification (W9); analyze write-down trend and feed into assortment/SLOB decisions (VS-05.3)
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4660_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4660_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4660_End7" name="Complete">
