    <bpmn:process id="W_W4661" name="W4661. Gross-Margin, MMU/IMU &amp; Maintained-Margin Analytics by SKU / Category / Store" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly margin review; pricing/markdown decisions
Frequency: Monthly + ad-hoc
Volume: ~35K SKUs × 200 stores × 5 entities (aggregated to category/region)
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager
Participants: Merchandising (VS-01/VS-101), Pricing (VS-01.2), FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), Insights (VS-28)
Source: workflow W4661 — Gross-Margin, MMU/IMU &amp; Maintained-Margin Analytics by SKU / Category / Store</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4661_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4661_Lane1" name="Cost Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4661_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4661_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4661_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4661_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4661_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4661_Start3" name="Monthly margin review; pricing/markdown decisions">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4661_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4661_Task4" name="Produce the margin analytics pack: gross margin % (net sales − COGS), initial…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Produce the margin analytics pack: gross margin % (net sales − COGS), initial markup (IMU), maintained markup (MMU) after markdowns, and GMROI by SKU/category/store/region/entity — using the cost layer (W4649/W4656) net of vendor funding (W4664)
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / FP&amp;A / Insights
Accountable (A): Controller / VP Merchandising
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4661_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4661_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4661_Task5" name="Identify margin outliers (below category floor, eroding trend, store-specific)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Identify margin outliers (below category floor, eroding trend, store-specific) and route to Merchandising/Pricing for action (VS-01.2/VS-101/VS-64 markdown); validate cost-data accuracy before acting on a margin signal
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4661_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4661_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4661_Task6" name="Tie aggregate margin to the PFRS financials and the merchandise-financial plan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Tie aggregate margin to the PFRS financials and the merchandise-financial plan (VS-101); feed maintained-margin into OTB and pricing strategy (VS-101/VS-01.2)
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Controller / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4661_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4661_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4661_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4661_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4661_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-705 (ensure controlled execution — Cost Variance, Actual-vs-Standard &amp; Margin Analytics (PA-158.2).) | - CTL-705: margin pack cost-data-validated; outliers routed; aggregate tied to PFRS financials
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
