    <bpmn:process id="W_W4662" name="W4662. Freight, Duty &amp; Handling Cost Absorption vs. Billback Analysis" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly freight/duty cost review; vendor compliance chargeback decisions
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Freight/duty/handling spend (VS-110/VS-87); vendor compliance chargebacks (W245)
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager
Participants: Logistics (VS-06/VS-110), Imports (VS-87), Vendor Mgmt (VS-03/VS-67), Controller
Source: workflow W4662 — Freight, Duty &amp; Handling Cost Absorption vs. Billback Analysis</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4662_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4662_Lane1" name="Cost Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4662_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4662_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4662_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4662_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4662_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4662_Start3" name="Monthly freight/duty cost review; vendor compliance chargeback decisions">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4662_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4662_Task4" name="Classify inbound freight/duty/handling cost as absorbed (into SKU cost per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Classify inbound freight/duty/handling cost as absorbed (into SKU cost per W4651/W4652) vs. billback-eligible (vendor non-compliance — wrong carrier, late shipment, packaging non-conformance per W245)
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Logistics
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4662_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4662_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4662_Task5" name="Bill back vendor-compliance-eligible cost (W245 chargebacks) and recover…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Bill back vendor-compliance-eligible cost (W245 chargebacks) and recover; analyze the absorb-vs-billback posture for net cost optimization (renegotiate Incoterms, routing-guide compliance — VS-110.2)
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): Controller / VP Merchandising
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4662_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4662_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4662_Task6" name="Quantify unrecovered billback-eligible cost as margin leakage; route to vendor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Quantify unrecovered billback-eligible cost as margin leakage; route to vendor scorecard (VS-67) and freight-procurement (VS-110) for structural recovery
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Logistics
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4662_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4662_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4662_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4662_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4662_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-705 (ensure controlled execution — Cost Variance, Actual-vs-Standard &amp; Margin Analytics (PA-158.2).) | - CTL-705: inbound cost classified absorb vs. billback; chargebacks evidence-based; unrecovered leakage quantified and routed
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
