    <bpmn:process id="W_W4663" name="W4663. Cost-of-Goods-Sold Reconciliation, Cut-off &amp; Period Matching" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Month-end close (W9A); COGS reconciliation
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: ~PHP 42–45B annual COGS; ~ every POS/sales transaction + every receipt/adjustment
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager
Participants: GL/Close (VS-17.1), Inventory (VS-05), POS (VS-08), Controller
Source: workflow W4663 — Cost-of-Goods-Sold Reconciliation, Cut-off &amp; Period Matching</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4663_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4663_Lane1" name="Cost Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4663_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4663_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4663_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4663_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4663_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4663_Start3" name="Month-end close (W9A); COGS reconciliation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4663_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4663_Task4" name="Reconcile COGS to the inventory movement: opening inventory + receipts (at…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Reconcile COGS to the inventory movement: opening inventory + receipts (at cost) + landed-cost adjustments − closing inventory = COGS; investigate any unexplained COGS variance
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / GL / Inventory
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per close</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4663_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4663_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4663_Task5" name="Perform COGS cut-off: ensure sales/shipments near period-end are matched to the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Perform COGS cut-off: ensure sales/shipments near period-end are matched to the corresponding COGS in the same period (and receipts in the correct period); clear cut-off exceptions
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per close</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4663_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4663_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4663_Task6" name="Reconcile COGS by entity/channel to revenue (margin tie-out) and to the PFRS…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconcile COGS by entity/channel to revenue (margin tie-out) and to the PFRS financials; resolve any entity-allocation or intercompany COGS distortion (VS-72)
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / GL
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per close</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4663_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4663_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4663_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4663_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4663_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-115 (ensure cost-master &amp; COGS reconciliation control.) | - CTL-705: COGS reconciled to inventory movement monthly; cut-off tested; entity COGS tied to revenue and PFRS financials
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
