    <bpmn:process id="W_W4664" name="W4664. Markdown, Promo &amp; Vendor-Funding Net-Cost Impact Accounting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Markdown/promo run (VS-01.2/VS-64); vendor rebate/funding (VS-39); monthly review
Frequency: Per promo + monthly
Volume: 6 major catalog promos/yr + monthly hot deals; vendor rebates (VS-39); co-op advertising
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager
Participants: Merchandising (VS-01.2/VS-64), Promo (VS-58), Rebate (VS-39), Pricing, Controller
Source: workflow W4664 — Markdown, Promo &amp; Vendor-Funding Net-Cost Impact Accounting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4664_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4664_Lane1" name="Cost Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4664_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4664_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4664_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4664_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4664_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4664_Start3" name="Markdown/promo run (VS-01.2/VS-64); vendor rebate/funding (VS-39); monthly review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4664_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4664_Task4" name="Determine the correct accounting for vendor funding: reduction of cost of goods…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Determine the correct accounting for vendor funding: reduction of cost of goods (net cost) vs. reduction of selling expense vs. other income — per PFRS and the documented policy; net rebates (VS-39) and co-op advertising against the funded SKU&#x27;s cost
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Rebate / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per funding type</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4664_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4664_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4664_Task5" name="Account for markdown/promo cost: temporary vs. permanent markdown, markdown…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Account for markdown/promo cost: temporary vs. permanent markdown, markdown reserve, and the net margin impact after vendor funding; post the markdown to margin or a markdown P&amp;L account per policy
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Pricing
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per promo</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4664_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4664_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4664_Task6" name="Reconcile vendor-funding accrual (VS-39) to actual receipts and to the net-cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconcile vendor-funding accrual (VS-39) to actual receipts and to the net-cost reduction claimed; identify unfunded/unclaimed vendor funding as recovery opportunity (VS-39.3)
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Rebate
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4664_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4664_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4664_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4664_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4664_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-705 (ensure controlled execution — Cost Variance, Actual-vs-Standard &amp; Margin Analytics (PA-158.2).) | - CTL-705: vendor-funding accounting policy documented (no double-count); markdown accounted per policy; accrual reconciled to receipts monthly
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
